### 3. 🔴 Destructured `useAuth()` Tokens Used Before Ready (`RISK_A`)
* **Repository:** `qcash-ui-helpdesk-portal` ([menu.ts](file://~/Development/qcash-ui-helpdesk-portal/services/menu.ts#L291))
