### The 4 Quick JS-to-Go Adjustments

| JavaScript Habit | Go Syntax | Why? |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`range Message`** | **`range messages`** | `messages` is the parameter variable list; `Message` is the type blueprint. |
